<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>If SetName is used to change the player character name, the FirstName macro continues to return the old name in conversation until a saved game is loaded. 
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Workarounds">Workarounds</span></h2>
<p>When testing, just live with it. For live gameplay, use SetName or the conversation macro, but not both.
</p>
